        <item>
            <title>0.2.5</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 13 Jun 2026 00:24:15 +0000</pubDate>
            <link>https://haynoi.com</link>
            <sparkle:version>16</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Haynoi 0.2.5</h2>

<h3>Changed</h3>
<ul>
<li>Haynoi is now a menu-bar app: no Dock icon while you work — it appears</li>
</ul>
<p>  only when the main window is open. Dictation works whenever the app is</p>
<p>  running.</p>
<ul>
<li>The menu bar panel shows your 5 most recent dictations, each with a</li>
</ul>
<p>  copy button right on the row.</p>
<ul>
<li>Removed the panel's Mode and Settings rows, which opened nothing.</li>
</ul>
<p>  Settings lives in the main window.</p>
<p><a href="https://github.com/sonpiaz/haynoi/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">View full changelog</a></p>
]]></description>
